    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>Night Elf racial traits.</p><ul><li>+2 Spirit; the detailed and summary tables conflict on the penalty, so no penalty is automated pending a campaign ruling.</li><li>Medium; land speed 30 feet; low-light vision.</li><li>+2 Knowledge (nature) and Survival, which are always class skills.</li><li>Treat moonglaives, moon swords, and warglaives as martial weapons.</li><li>Automatic Common and Darnassian; bonus Goblin, Low Common, Orcish, and Thalassian.</li><li>Favored class Scout; eligible for up to three night elf racial levels.</li></ul>"
    },
